     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與早年",
      "en": "Birth and early career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "塔德烏什·庫特熱巴1886年4月15日生於克拉科夫。1910年他被派往維也納的總參謀部學院就讀。1920年華沙戰役期間，他擔任參謀長，並領導第2軍的參謀部。",
      "en": "Tadeusz Kutrzeba was born in Kraków on 15 April 1886. In 1910 he was sent to study at the General Staff academy in Vienna. During the 1920 Battle of Warsaw he was a chief of staff and headed the staff of the 2nd Army."
     },
