     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰間期的參謀與教育職務",
      "en": "Interwar staff and school posts"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1927年3月16日，庫特熱巴晉升准將，次年出任華沙高等軍事學校校長。另一份館藏文章也記載他領導過該校。",
      "en": "Kutrzeba was promoted to brigadier general on 16 March 1927 and the following year became commandant of the Higher War School in Warsaw. A second source also records that he headed that school."
     },
