    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-03-19",
      "end": "1939-09-28"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "一九三九年：波茲南軍與布祖拉反擊",
      "en": "1939: Poznań Army and the Bzura counterattack"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年3月19日他晉升少將並出任軍監，四天後被任命為「波茲南」軍司令。該軍轄四個步兵師與兩個騎兵旅，防守波茲南突出部。戰役中他擬定並執行反擊計畫，即後來的布祖拉會戰。突圍至華沙後，他成為「華沙」軍司令羅梅爾的副手，並於9月28日在首都投降書上簽字。",
      "en": "On 19 March 1939 he was promoted to major general and appointed army inspector; four days later he was named commander of Army 'Poznań', which had four infantry divisions and two cavalry brigades defending the Poznań salient. He drew up and carried out the counteroffensive plan that became the Battle of the Bzura. After reaching Warsaw he became deputy to Gen. Rómmel of Army 'Warszawa' and on 28 September signed the capital's capitulation."
     },
