     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰俘、流亡與逝世",
      "en": "Captivity, exile and death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "庫特熱巴被關進德軍戰俘營，自1942年4月起長期關在巴伐利亞的穆爾瑙戰俘營。1945年解放後他抵達倫敦。他因癌症於1947年1月8日在倫敦去世。",
      "en": "He was held in German prisoner-of-war camps, longest at Murnau in Bavaria from April 1942. After liberation in 1945 he reached London, and he died of cancer in London on 8 January 1947."
     },
